---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Refund & Returns Policy — Tee Shop">
	<div class="simple-page align-left">
		<h1>Refund &amp; Returns Policy</h1>
		<p><em>Last updated: [date]. This is a starting draft, not legal advice — have it reviewed before relying on it.</em></p>

		<h2>Made to order</h2>
		<p>
			Every item is printed specifically for your order — nothing is kept in stock. Because of
			this, we can only accept returns for items that arrive damaged, defective, or
			significantly different from what you ordered.
		</p>

		<h2>Damaged or defective items</h2>
		<p>
			If your order arrives damaged or with a printing defect, email
			<a href="mailto:hello@example.com">hello@example.com</a> within [14] days of delivery with
			your order number and a photo of the issue. We'll send a replacement or issue a refund.
		</p>

		<h2>Wrong size or change of mind</h2>
		<p>
			Because each item is printed to order, we [do not / do — choose one] accept returns for
			sizing issues or change of mind. Please check the size guide carefully before ordering.
		</p>

		<h2>How refunds work</h2>
		<p>
			Approved refunds are issued to your original payment method via Stripe and typically
			appear within 5–10 business days, depending on your bank.
		</p>

		<h2>Contact</h2>
		<p>Questions about an order? Email <a href="mailto:hello@example.com">hello@example.com</a>.</p>
	</div>
</Layout>
